Respond ONLY with a valid JSON object in this exact format with no markdown and no extra text: {"subject": "short ops-style subject line under 12 words", "headline": "6-10 word one-line summary of the week", "summary": "the executive summary paragraph", "actions": ["action item 1", "action item 2", "action item 3"]}" },
    { "role": "user",   "content": "Week of: {{ $json["weekLabel"] }}
