The Groq narrative did not parse cleanly this week. The brief fell back to deterministic stats only.

Week: {{ $('Code — Aggregate Health Stats').item.json['weekLabel'] }}
Events this week: {{ $('Code — Aggregate Health Stats').item.json['totals']['totalEventsWeek'] }}

_Prompt: {{ $('Code — Parse Brief').item.json['promptVersion'] }}_
